cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this MATLAB research code package, please cite both
  the version-specific Zenodo research code archive
  (https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24376136)
  and the associated published research article
  (https://doi.org/10.1016/j.amc.2026.130419).
type: software
title: >-
  From Accuracy to Uncertainty: A Framework for RBF Interpolation
  Comparable to Kriging — MATLAB Research Code and Reproducibility Package
abstract: >-
  MATLAB research code package accompanying the manuscript
  "From Accuracy to Uncertainty: A Framework for RBF Interpolation
  Comparable to Kriging". The package provides Global- and Local-RBF
  workflows, parameter optimisation, bootstrap uncertainty calibration,
  sensitivity analyses, configuration settings, random seeds, and scripts
  for generating principal figures and tables. Restricted geodetic data
  are not included.
